Update the Jenkins controller IAM configuration to attach the AWS-managed CloudWatchAgentServerPolicy to the existing IAM role dev_jenkins_main_ssm_role.

This change enables the Amazon CloudWatch Agent installed on the Jenkins controller EC2 instance to publish system metrics and logs to AWS CloudWatch for improved infrastructure monitoring and visibility.

Changes:

Update the Jenkins controller iam.tf Terraform configuration.

Attach the AWS-managed CloudWatchAgentServerPolicy to the existing IAM role.

Enable permissions for publishing CPU, memory, disk utilization metrics, and CloudWatch logs.

Preserve all existing IAM policies and Jenkins controller functionality.
